  ],
  "hints": [
    "The differing positions are `d = a ^ b`.",
    "At most one bit set means d is 0 or a power of two: `(d & (d - 1)) == 0`."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "check": "worked examples",
      "title": "one bit",
